
This folder contains input file, grid file, mass matrix file, stiffness matrix file
for the flexible barge case with the 6mm high steel plates in the Journal paper 

'Solving for hydroelastic ship response using a high-order finite difference method on overlapping grids at zero speed'

Note that please select the Eulerian beam model inside the codes, 'OW3DConstants.cpp'.
Both Newman and Malenica hydrostatic models have been used in this paper, and select the assicated one for different cases inside codes, 'OW3DConstants.cpp'.

